WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.833
- Can't believe it's come to this...

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:05.541
- Hi, I'm Najee,
and I'm an underperforming fantasy player.

00:00:05.541 --> 00:00:07.125
- Hi, Najee.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.708
- I mean, what does Magic Johnson know
about winning, anyway?

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.500
- I told y’all. I don't belong here.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.666
I was a Pro Bowler!

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:14.333
- [Carr:] Me too!
- [Tannehill:] Me too!

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.000
- Say it with me, everyone:

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.458
- Nobody cares about the Pro Bowl.

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:18.958
- Welcome.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:21.125
And believe it or not,
I used to be just like you.

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:23.500
I once got benched for John Wolford. 
- [GASPS]

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.000
- It's true.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.500
But now, I'm a straight baller.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:25.916
- [SNAPS]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.250
- Hey, I'm just blue collar Kenny Pickett.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.833
Just a lunch pail and jeans fella that was
lucky enough to make it out of the Pitt.

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:35.125
Lost a lot of good men lately, Diontae...Cam.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:37.708
But hey, that's just life,
down at the steel yard.

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:42.041
- I don't trust myself to leave home because
that's the only place I can perform.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:46.291
- I took too much money from some men you do NOT want to upset, 

00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:48.541
and now I'm getting all sorts of threats.

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:50.125
- So we pull up to this club in Ibiza-

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:51.833
- Jimmy, we're supposed to talk
about our struggles. 

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:52.750
- Oh, am I struggling?

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.000
- I used to be Joe Sheisty.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.625
I thought I was invincible.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.875
But then, you know, you get hammered
in Cleveland once and it becomes a habit.

00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:12.791
Next thing you know,
you're getting blown out by the Titans.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:13.666
- Hey!

00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:15.666
- Tell me Sheisty, are you a praying man? 

00:01:15.791 --> 00:01:19.083
- You know you can't let people down
if everyone thinks you're just a lil stinker.

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:22.875
- It's just for so long
I've acted really cool all the time.

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.166
And sometimes Joe Burrow hurts.

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:26.916
- Joe Burrow?!
- [Jimmy G:] Bill Skarsgard?!

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:29.500
- I'm struggling,
and I don't know what to do.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.750
- Oh, you play the Cardinals.

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:33.208
- Hey, Joe. I need a ride
home from my hot seat meeting.

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.666
- I grew up with small town American values.

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.833
Sock hop on a Friday. Church on Sunday.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.458
But all that's gone now.

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:43.916
Down in the trenches, the American way is dead.

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:45.750
Instead,
it's the Canada way.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.916
The Matt Canada way.

00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:48.750
And it makes no sense to me at all.

